!Name: p90sidelwss-2
!C A period 90 c/3 puffer that produces a sideways LWSS.
!C This works by hitting a p90 spacehip with gliders from a p90 forwards rake.
!C The rake can be replaced by individual incoming gliders to form a triggerable
!C LWSS puffer.  Delaying the gliders from the rake by one generation produces
!C MWSS's instead.
!C David I. Bell, May 1998
!Source: jslife-moving
!
